# Packages (core / server / react)

Protocol change: `core` routes + types → `createS3Client` → `dimahS3` procedures + HTTP handler → react hooks. No duplicate route strings.

New procedure: `procedures/` + `DimahS3Config` hooks. New react hook: `hooks/` + `upload/` helpers; depend on `@dimah-s3/core` only.

Server plugins: contract in `packages/server/src/plugin/` (`definePlugin`, `createEndpoint`, `applyPlugins`). Client plugins: `@dimah-s3/core` (`defineClientPlugin`, `createS3Client({ plugins })`, `pluginEndpointPath`); React apps use `createS3Client` from `@dimah-s3/react`. Feature plugins (e.g. `db()` / `dbClient()`) in their packages. Merge once in `dimahS3()`; contexts flatten onto the instance (`s3[id]`).

Public API change → Tegami changelog (`.tegami/`). Build: `tsup` + `package.json` `exports`.

